    "difficulty": "HARD",
    "stem": "Find minors and cofactors of the elements of the determinant \\(\\begin{vmatrix} 2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & -7 \\end{vmatrix}\\) and verify that \\(a_{11} A_{31} + a_{12} A_{32} + a_{13} A_{33} = 0\\)",
